# Extra non-package files required in the source distribution.
# gimp-mcp-plugin.py is the GIMP-embedded entry (hyphenated name — not a py-module).
# It must ship in the sdist so operators can install from source; it is NOT
# required in the wheel (host package ≠ APPDATA plug-in install path).
include gimp-mcp-plugin.py
include CHANGELOG.md
include SECURITY.md
include GIMP_MCP_PROTOCOL.md
